{"id":"wcce-c4275a446663","title":"关于做好我院2026年研究生国家奖学金评选工作的通知","date":"2026-09-21","source":"wcce","source_name":"水利与土木工程学院","channel":"通知公告","url":"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/2026/0920/c4275a446663/page.htm","summary":"各研究生： 根据学校《关于开展我校 2026 年研究生国家奖学金评选工作的通知》、《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》等通知和文件精神，现就做好我院 2026 年研究生国家奖学金评选工作安排如下： 一、 2023 级、 2024 级、 2025 级博士研究生及 2024 级、 2025 级硕士研究生评选 1. 评选名额 2023 级、 2024 级、…","content_html":"<div class=\"wp_articlecontent\"><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>各研究生：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>根据学校《关于开展我校</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年研究生国家奖学金评选工作的通知》、《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》等通知和文件精神，现就做好我院</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年研究生国家奖学金评选工作安排如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>一、</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2023</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级、</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2024</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级、</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级博士研究生及</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2024</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span