pan></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>评选流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）学生申请。研究生本人于</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>23</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>上午</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>12</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>:00</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>前</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>将</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>申请材料</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>提交至院楼</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>215</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>室辅导员处</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>，包括：《研究生国家奖学金申请审批表》（附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）、《</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年广东省硕士研究生国家奖学金获奖学生汇总表》（附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>），需同时提交纸质版</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>电子版以及参评的佐证材料（要求见《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）学院初评。学院根据学校下达的评选名额进行初评、公示，并</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>报送学校</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>二、</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级研究生评选</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>评选名额</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我院</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级研究生新生推荐参评国家奖学金的上限人数，以《</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年各学院研究生新生参评国奖可推荐人数》（附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）为准。我院</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级研究生新生最多可推荐参评国家奖学金为博士</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>人、硕士</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>人。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>参评新生国家奖学金的博士生，必须满足以下条件：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>硕士在读期间以第一作者（共同第一作者，排序需第一）身份取得以下科研成果中的一项：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span> ①<span><span><span><span><span><span><span>发表高水平论文</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>篇；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span> ②<span><span><span><span><span><span><span>获得授权发明专利</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>项；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span> ③<span><span><span><span><span><span><span>其他突出科研成果</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>项。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>如在硕士阶段已获得硕士国家奖学金的申请者，当时已使用过的科研成果不得在本次评选工作中再次申报。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>参评新生国家奖学金的硕士生，必须满足以下条件：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>本科阶段获得校级一等奖学金或国家级奖学金、国家励志奖学金，且满足以下一项：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span> ①<span><span><span><span><span><span><span>普通招考生入学考试初试成绩总分在本学科门类排名前</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3%</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>；②推荐免试生本科阶段平均学分绩点在硕士一级学科排名第一（含并列第一）。符合参评成绩条件的推免生及普通招考生名单详见《附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级研究生新生符合参评成绩条件学生名单》。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>评选</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>流程</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）学生申请。研究生本人于</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>23</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>上午</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>12</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>:00</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>前</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>将</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>申请材料</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>提交至院楼</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>215</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>室辅导员处</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>材料如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>电子版：《</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年广东省博士研究生国家奖学金获奖学生汇总表》（附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）、《</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年广东省硕士研究生国家奖学金获奖学生汇总表》（附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）、《</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年研究生新生国家奖学金评选信息表》（附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>纸质版：《研究生国家奖学金申请审批表》（附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>），一式一份</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>双面打印；《</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年研究生新生国家奖学金评选信息表》（附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）。参评研究生相关证明材料纸质版</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>毕业证书及学位证书复印件</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>加盖教务部门公章的包含平均学分绩点的成绩单复印件（硕士生新生提供本科阶段成绩单、博士生新生提供硕士生阶段成绩单）</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>评选信息表中列出的各项参评信息的佐证材料（按表格信息顺序放置）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a name=\"_GoBack\"></a><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）学院推荐。学院对新生提交的申请材料，包括相关证明材料（本科成绩单、科研成果、竞赛成绩等）进行审核，并向学校报送推荐名单。学院上报候选人不得超过附件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>的名额上限，由学校择优遴选确定最终获奖人员。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>三、评选架构</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学院研究生国家奖学金评审工作小组</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>组长：叶晖有、齐龙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>副组长：黄慧娟、张巍</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>组员：韦未、叶可可、何春保、张丹、张轩国</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学院研究生国家奖学金初评工作小组</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>组长：张丹</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>副组长：陈继敏、陈籽伊、张轩国</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>组员：任绍杰、蒋旭、苏浩、张昉忻、蒋雨彤、陈奕丽</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>四、相关说明</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级硕博连读生，统一按</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级博士生身份参与本次国家奖学金评选。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>所有评选材料需要按时提交，逾期提交的视为无效。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>评选过程中，如发现学生存在材料造假、隐瞒信息等违规行为，一经查实，立即取消其参评资格，已获奖的取消获奖资格并追回奖金，同时按学校相关规定进行处理。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>评选材料电子版分类统一打包压缩发送至邮箱</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2306555095@qq.com</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，邮件、文件命名格式：“国奖</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>姓名</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学号”。纸质版材料请务必按照相关要求填写信息、签字后再提交。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>水利与土木工程学院</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>21</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_rar.gif\"/><a href=\"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/5e/cb/4d2bcdd94c869e4c0ac40de0d17b/6bfea36e-e1fb-45a7-9457-91d6175d48eb.rar\">附件.rar</a></p></div></div>","content_text":"各研究生：\n根据学校《关于开展我校\n2026\n年研究生国家奖学金评选工作的通知》、《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》等通知和文件精神，现就做好我院\n2026\n年研究生国家奖学金评选工作安排如下：\n一、\n2023\n级、\n2024\n级、\n2025\n级博士研究生及\n2024\n级、\n2025\n级硕士研究生评选\n1.\n评选名额\n2023\n级、\n2024\n级、\n2025\n级博士研究生\n0\n人，\n2024\n级、\n2025\n级硕士研究生\n3\n人。\n2.\n评选要求\n评选要求及申请材料详见《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》。\n3.\n评选流程\n（\n1\n）学生申请。研究生本人于\n9\n月\n23\n日\n上午\n12\n:00\n前\n将\n申请材料\n提交至院楼\n215\n室辅导员处\n，包括：《研究生国家奖学金申请审批表》（附件\n2\n）、《\n202\n6\n年广东省硕士研究生国家奖学金获奖学生汇总表》（附件\n4\n），需同时提交纸质版\n、\n电子版以及参评的佐证材料（要求见《水利与土木工程学院研究生奖助学金评选办法》）。\n（\n2\n）学院初评。学院根据学校下达的评选名额进行初评、公示，并\n报送学校\n。\n二、\n202\n6\n级研究生评选\n1.\n评选名额\n我院\n2026\n级研究生新生推荐参评国家奖学金的上限人数，以《\n2026\n年各学院研究生新生参评国奖可推荐人数》（附件\n5\n）为准。我院\n2026\n级研究生新生最多可推荐参评国家奖学金为博士\n1\n人、硕士\n1\n人。\n参评新生国家奖学金的博士生，必须满足以下条件：\n硕士在读期间以第一作者（共同第一作者，排序需第一）身份取得以下科研成果中的一项：\n①\n发表高水平论文\n1\n篇；\n②\n获得授权发明专利\n1\n项；\n③\n其他突出科研成果\n1\n项。\n如在硕士阶段已获得硕士国家奖学金的申请者，当时已使用过的科研成果不得在本次评选工作中再次申报。\n参评新生国家奖学金的硕士生，必须满足以下条件：\n本科阶段获得校级一等奖学金或国家级奖学金、国家励志奖学金，且满足以下一项：\n①\n普通招考生入学考试初试成绩总分在本学科门类排名前\n3%\n；②推荐免试生本科阶段平均学分绩点在硕士一级学科排名第一（含并列第一）。符合参评成绩条件的推免生及普通招考生名单详见《附件\n3\n：\n2026\n级研究生新生符合参评成绩条件学生名单》。\n2\n.\n评选\n流程\n（\n1\n）学生申请。研究生本人于\n9\n月\n23\n日\n上午\n12\n:00\n前\n将\n申请材料\n提交至院楼\n215\n室辅导员处\n。\n材料如下：\n电子版：《\n202\n6\n年广东省博士研究生国家奖学金获奖学生汇总表》（附件\n3\n）、《\n202\n6\n年广东省硕士研究生国家奖学金获奖学生汇总表》（附件\n4\n）、《\n202\n6\n年研究生新生国家奖学金评选信息表》（附件\n7\n）；\n纸质版：《研究生国家奖学金申请审批表》（附件\n2\n），一式一份\n、\n双面打印；《\n202\n6\n年研究生新生国家奖学金评选信息表》（附件\n7\n）。参评研究生相关证明材料纸质版\n、\n毕业证书及学位证书复印件\n、\n加盖教务部门公章的包含平均学分绩点的成绩单复印件（硕士生新生提供本科阶段成绩单、博士生新生提供硕士生阶段成绩单）\n、\n附件\n7\n评选信息表中列出的各项参评信息的佐证材料（按表格信息顺序放置）。\n（\n2\n）学院推荐。学院对新生提交的申请材料，包括相关证明材料（本科成绩单、科研成果、竞赛成绩等）进行审核，并向学校报送推荐名单。学院上报候选人不得超过附件\n5\n的名额上限，由学校择优遴选确定最终获奖人员。\n三、评选架构\n1.\n学院研究生国家奖学金评审工作小组\n组长：叶晖有、齐龙\n副组长：黄慧娟、张巍\n组员：韦未、叶可可、何春保、张丹、张轩国\n2.\n学院研究生国家奖学金初评工作小组\n组长：张丹\n副组长：陈继敏、陈籽伊、张轩国\n组员：任绍杰、蒋旭、苏浩、张昉忻、蒋雨彤、陈奕丽\n四、相关说明\n1.2026\n级硕博连读生，统一按\n2026\n级博士生身份参与本次国家奖学金评选。\n2.\n所有评选材料需要按时提交，逾期提交的视为无效。\n3.\n评选过程中，如发现学生存在材料造假、隐瞒信息等违规行为，一经查实，立即取消其参评资格，已获奖的取消获奖资格并追回奖金，同时按学校相关规定进行处理。\n4.\n评选材料电子版分类统一打包压缩发送至邮箱\n2306555095@qq.com\n，邮件、文件命名格式：“国奖\n+\n姓名\n+\n学号”。纸质版材料请务必按照相关要求填写信息、签字后再提交。\n水利与土木工程学院\n2026\n年\n9\n月\n21\n日\n附件.rar","attachments":[{"name":"附件.rar","url":"https://wcce.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/5e/cb/4d2bcdd94c869e4c0ac40de0d17b/6bfea36e-e1fb-45a7-9457-91d6175d48eb.rar"}],"status":"ok","crawled_at":"2026-11-08T23:28:13+08:00"}